  "verse_id": "pdva-p01-v01",
  "song": "pdva-p01",
  "verse": 1,
  "quick_english": "Enjoy peace always; with few words, stop the chatter-course; by its stopping-way — what, how is this, who am I — don't doubt. What shines unbroken in sequence, making being and non-being shine apart — that void, Śiva's abode, the highest real thing, brahman — then who grasps here?",
