 {
  "verse_id": "pdva-p01-v03",
  "song": "pdva-p01",
  "verse": 3,
  "quick_english": "Whatever shines, not apart from shining — if you say even difference shines, it does not shine in shining — so abandon the grasping of its breaking-ways. In dream, having become dream-ness, mere play, no fright-maker — sword-blows, water-plunges, fire-eating, thunder-claps and the rest.",
