 {
  "verse_id": "pdva-p01-v05",
  "song": "pdva-p01",
  "verse": 5,
  "quick_english": "If you, the illuminator of beings, are smeared by them — what is that to you? If it shines, hail — your unbroken greatness even there. If not, it is not — thus even so, both ways, unrestrained-unfettered, with unbroken delusion ever content and great — ever-awake you are, sir.",
